Priority: optional
Maintainer: KubeOS <mail@kubeos.in>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://kubeos.in/

Package: kubeos-network
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, iptables, iproute2, ca-certificates, kubernetes-cni
Description: KubeOS pod networking: CNI plugins, flanneld and cluster DNS
 The pieces of the pod network a KubeOS node runs itself, without a DaemonSet and
 without a Pod: flanneld for the overlay and CoreDNS answering cluster names as a
 systemd unit.
 .
 The CNI plugins containerd calls (bridge, host-local, loopback, portmap) are NOT
 shipped here: kubernetes-cni - a dependency of the kubelet package, same upstream
 version - already owns /opt/cni/bin, and a second copy was a dpkg conflict, not a
 feature.
 .
 Also carries the runtime prerequisites that belong to networking: /etc/crictl.yaml,
 the sysctl values pod routing needs and the br_netfilter/overlay modules. Upstream
 ships no Debian packages for any of the binaries, so they are fetched and
 checksum-verified at build time.
